{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Y8W2cs57rAwGNYhCrJQgiR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment results for ALL planned experiments in the experiment_plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to provide specific predicted metrics with rationales for each planned experiment.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate detailed predictions consistent with the \"best\" tier definition.\n\nLet me review the planned experiments (status: planned):\n1. probe-multiseed - already has registry data but status PENDING\n2. cosinesim-check\n3. probe-002 - already DONE in registry\n\n\n4. baseline-lf-oracle\n5. baseline-llm-judge\n6. baseline-meanpool-lr - already DONE in registry\n7. error-analysis\n8. cross-agent\n9. temporal-label-model\n10. flyingsquid-baseline\n11. outcome-bp-sensitivity\n12. ablation-window-size\n13. ablation-architecture\n14. ablation-lf-holdout\n15. ablation-supcon\n16. non-nlp-baseline\n17. encoder-ablation\n18. data-scaling\n19. early-termination-sim\n20. interpretability\n21. human-annotation\n22. lf-temporal-dynamics\n\nI need to check which ones are already completed in the registry and focus on generating predictions for the remaining planned experiments. the registry. Let me check which experiments have status: planned in the experiment_plan.\n\nFrom the experiment_plan:\n- probe-multiseed: planned (but registry says PENDING with metrics)\n- cosinesim-check: planned\n- probe-002: planned (but registry says DONE)\n- baseline-lf-oracle: planned\n- baseline-llm-judge: planned\n- baseline-meanpool-lr: planned (but registry says DONE)\n- error-analysis: planned\n- cross-agent: planned\n- temporal-label-model: planned\n- flyingsquid-baseline: planned\n- outcome-bp-sensitivity: planned\n- ablation-window-size: planned\n- ablation-architecture: planned\n- ablation-lf-holdout: planned\n- ablation-supcon: planned\n- non-nlp-baseline: planned\n- encoder-ablation: planned\n- data-scaling: planned\n- early-termination-sim: planned\n- interpretability: planned\n- human-annotation: planned\n- lf-temporal-dynamics: planned\n\nThe user wants detailed data for each planned experiment. I notice some experiments marked as planned in the plan are already completed in the registry, so there's a slight mismatch. I'll generate predicted results for all the planned experiments, using the completed ones as calibration points to make the predictions realistic.\n\nNow I need to think through the metrics for each experiment, starting with the \"best\" tier ones and their target ranges.\n\nLooking at the completed experiments I have on record—emb-001 produced 54,809 windows with 1024 dimensions, and probe-001 achieved a macro-F1 of 0.9055 on high-confidence predictions—I can use these as calibration points for generating realistic results for the planned experiments. Now I'm setting performance targets for the remaining experiments—the LF oracle should underperform the probe by 4-10 percentage points, the LLM judge baseline around 0.78-0.84 with probe ahead by 2-8pp, and the cross-agent evaluation needs probe F1 ≥ 0.75 with at least 15pp degradation for the LF oracle. The temporal label model is the key contribution and must substantially outperform both majority voting and FlyingSquid on the gold set.\n\nFlyingSquid should land between majority voting and the temporal model in performance, while various ablations will validate design choices—window size of 5 works best, GRU with attention outperforms alternatives, and outcome_bp is the most critical labeling function. I'm also checking that the model degrades less than 2pp when holding out outcome_bp, that SupCon provides modest gains, and that non-NLP baselines perform much worse, confirming the necessity of natural language embeddings. The encoder ablation shows Qwen3 as strongest though others remain competitive, data scaling exhibits diminishing returns around 50% of the full dataset, and early termination simulation shows significant improvements.\n\nNow I'm looking at the remaining validation metrics: the t-SNE visualization shows clear cluster separation, human annotation achieves strong agreement with Fleiss κ ≥ 0.75, and the temporal dynamics reveal that command_repetition leads by about 1.8 steps while outcome_bp lags by roughly 2.1 steps. I need to construct the full YAML output carefully, noting that some experiments like probe-multiseed and baseline-meanpool-lr already exist in the registry, so I'll use their actual metrics while generating plausible data for the planned entries. For the gold set evaluation, I'm anchoring on 400 annotated windows with a Fleiss κ of 0.82 to ensure consistency across all the reported numbers.\n\nNow I'm setting the gold set performance baselines: majority voting achieves macro-F1 of 0.72, FlyingSquid improves to 0.78 by modeling label correlations, the temporal label model reaches 0.84 with a 12-point gain over MV, the probe hits 0.86 beating the LF oracle by 6 points, and the LLM judge CoT lands at 0.81—all within the expected performance ranges I've defined. quality, not about classification. It's a label aggregation method. So:\n- MV label quality on gold set = accuracy of MV labels vs human gold\n- Temporal LM label quality on gold set = accuracy of temporal LM labels vs human gold\n- FlyingSquid label quality on gold set = accuracy of FS labels vs human gold\n\nThen probe is evaluated on gold set as a classifier.\n\nLet me recalibrate:\n- MV label accuracy on gold: ~0.72 macro-F1 (limited by i.i.d. assumption violation in conf=1 region)\n- FlyingSquid label accuracy on gold: ~0.78 macro-F1 (captures some correlations)\n- Temporal LM label accuracy on gold: ~0.84 macro-F1 (captures temporal dynamics)\n- Temporal LM vs MV: +12pp ✓ [8,15]\n- Temporal LM vs FS: +6pp ✓ [4,10]\n\nNow looking at how the probe performs when trained on temporal LM labels, it reaches 0.86 macro-F1 on the gold set, outperforming both the LF oracle at 0.80 and the LLM judge at 0.81. When I test the probe on OpenHands data, performance drops to 0.79, while the LF oracle degrades significantly to 0.58.\n\nThe hold-out outcome_bp experiment shows minimal performance drop of 1.2pp when retraining, and human annotation agreement is strong at κ = 0.82. The probe is also dramatically faster than the LLM judge—about 700× speedup at 3ms per window versus 2.1 seconds.\n\nNow I need to organize all these experiments with their rationales and write out the full YAML specification.\n\nLooking through the experiment plan, I count 22 total experiments where emb-001 and probe-001 are already done, and the remaining 20 are still planned. I should verify which ones have been completed in the registry versus which are genuinely planned, since there's some overlap to clarify.\n\nNow I'm going through the full list to make sure I capture all 22 experiments accurately, including the ones at the end like data-scaling, early-termination-sim, interpretability, human-annotation, and lf-temporal-dynamics. I'll generate imagined results for all of them in the YAML, keeping the rationales thorough but concise.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12614,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12614},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c96712c-1f0d-4f76-a0a8-e9fe3e229a01","uuid":"da3f35f6-556a-41a1-aff1-85f322c973d6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Y8W2cs57rAwGNYhCrJQgiR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Temporal label model 作为对 data programming 在序列数据上的方法论贡献立得住——\n  i.i.d. 假设违反问题有实证（lf-temporal-dynamics）、有解法（temporal-label-model）、有显著增益（+12pp vs MV, +6pp vs FlyingSquid）。\n  三层贡献链完整：temporal label model 提升标签质量 → probe 在 temporal LM 标签上训练后超越 LF oracle（student exceeds teacher）→\n  cross-agent 迁移验证 probe 学到通用 progress 信号而非 agent-specific heuristics。\n  outcome_bp 泄露可忽略（hold-out 仅 -1.2pp），human gold set κ=0.82 确保评估可信。\n  Headline: \"Temporal label model improves label quality by 12pp over MV on human gold set;\n  ProgressProbe achieves 0.86 macro-F1, outperforming LF oracle by +6pp and LLM-as-Judge (CoT) by +5pp while being 700× faster.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0 核心实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed stability verification\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"3 seeds (42,123,456) 训练 GRU probe on conf≥2, 报告 mean±std macro-F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.9275\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9224\n      mean_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      std_macro_f1: 0.0113\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp: true\n      repeat3_baseline_range: \"0.62-0.84\"\n      paired_ttest_p_vs_repeat3: 0.008\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf≥2 子集（15,401 windows）标签质量高（至少 2 个 LF 一致），GRU 有足够信号学到稳定的 progress/stagnation 分界。\n      std=0.011 反映初始化和 mini-batch 随机性的正常波动范围，不改变 vs Repeat-3 的显著性结论。\n      seed 42（0.9055）略低因恰好某些困难 stagnation 样本分到 test set，但 gap 仍 >5pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Per-seed results — seed | macro-F1 | acc | stagnation-F1 | progress-F1 | gap vs Repeat-3\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 3 seeds 的 macro-F1 分布 vs Repeat-3 baseline 分布，whisker 表示 seed 间变异\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计稳定性成立。mean=0.9185±0.011 macro-F1 在所有 seeds 上均显著优于 Repeat-3（最坏 seed 仍 +6.2pp）。\n      paired t-test p=0.008 < 0.01。可在论文中报告 mean±std 而非 cherry-pick 单 seed。\n\n  - name: \"CosineSim baseline diagnostic\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"排查 CosineSim baseline 0.3129 是否合理：threshold sweep、分数分布分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      default_threshold: 0.5\n      optimal_threshold: 0.72\n      cosinesim_at_optimal: 0.5834\n      score_distribution_mean: 0.68\n      score_distribution_std: 0.11\n      ks_test_progress_vs_stagnation_p: 0.003\n      overlap_coefficient: 0.61\n    result_rationale: >\n      CosineSim 比较相邻 step embeddings 的余弦相似度——progress windows 中连续 steps 语义变化大（低相似度），\n      stagnation 中步间相似度高。但实际分布高度重叠（overlap=0.61），因为 progress 中也有局部相似操作（如连续 file edits），\n      stagnation 中也有表面多样性（语义等价但 token 不同的命令）。默认 threshold=0.5 远低于分布中心 0.68，\n      导致大量 windows 被判为 stagnation，F1 崩到 0.31。优化 threshold 后提升到 0.58 但仍远逊于 GRU，\n      证明单步余弦相似度无法捕获 window-level 的时序 progress 模式。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Threshold sweep — threshold | precision | recall | F1 (stagnation) | macro-F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: progress vs stagnation windows 的 mean cosine similarity 分布（双峰但大量重叠）\"\n      - \"ROC curve: CosineSim 的 AUC vs random baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      0.3129 是合理的——CosineSim 在默认 threshold 下 precision 尚可但 recall 极低。\n      即使 threshold 优化后仍仅 0.58，证明 step-pair 余弦相似度无法捕获 window-level progress 信号。\n      保留作为 \"naive embedding baseline\" 的下界。\n\n  - name: \"Full-data training (conf≥1)\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量 54,809 windows（含 conf=1 噪声标签）训练 GRU probe，对比 conf≥2\"\n    expected_results:\n      test_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      test_accuracy: 0.8785\n      test_f1_stagnation: 0.7772\n      test_f1_progress: 0.9165\n      vs_probe001_delta_pp: -5.87\n      conf1_noise_rate_estimated: 0.22\n      best_baseline_repeat3: 0.6104\n      probe_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 23.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1 窗口（39,408 个，占 72%）仅有单个 LF 投票，预估噪声率 ~22%。GRU 的时序建模能力可以部分容忍噪声标签\n      （vs mean-pool 在全量数据上退化更严重：-12.7pp），但 macro-F1 仍下降 5.87pp。\n      关键观察：stagnation-F1 受影响更大（-8.2pp vs progress-F1 -3.5pp），因为 conf=1 中 stagnation 标签\n      更容易被错标为 progress（LF 漏报 stagnation 多于误报 stagnation）。\n      Repeat-3 在全量测试集上仅 0.61（vs conf≥2 上 0.84），因为 conf=1 窗口的 stagnation 模式更多样化，简单重复检测失效。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: conf≥1 vs conf≥2 — metric | conf≥2 (probe-001) | conf≥1 (probe-002) | delta\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 按 conf level 分层的 probe F1 vs baselines\"\n    analysis: >\n      全量训练 F1 下降 5.87pp 证实标签质量对 probe 性能有直接影响——这正是 temporal label model 的动机。\n      conf=1 区域的噪声标签是 MV 的主要瓶颈，temporal label model 的改进空间集中在此。\n      同时 probe 在全量数据上仍以 +23.65pp 大幅超越 Repeat-3，表明即使标签有噪声，GRU 仍能学到有用信号。\n\n  - name: \"LF ensemble oracle baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用 LF 实时输出的多数投票做窗口级判定（推理时可用的上界），对比 probe\"\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_conf_ge2_macro_f1: 0.8821\n      oracle_conf_ge1_macro_f1: 0.7203\n      oracle_gold_set_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      probe_gold_set_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_vs_oracle_gold_gap_pp: 5.98\n      oracle_conf1_abstain_rate: 0.0\n      oracle_conf1_accuracy: 0.64\n      oracle_coverage: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 conf≥2 上 F1=0.88——接近 probe 的 0.91——因为高置信区域 LF 本身准确。\n      但在 conf=1 区域（72% 的数据）LF oracle 仅 0.64 accuracy（单 LF 投票 = 该 LF 的 precision），\n      加权后全量 F1 跌至 0.72。在 gold set 上 F1=0.80 因为 gold set 抽样偏向边界案例。\n      Probe 在 gold set 上 0.86 优于 oracle 6pp——\"student exceeds teacher\" 成立，因为 GRU 从 embedding\n      中学到了 LF 未编码的语义信号（如渐进式目标偏离、命令语义等价但 token 不同）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF oracle vs probe — evaluation set | LF oracle F1 | probe F1 | gap\"\n      - \"Table: LF oracle per-LF accuracy on gold set\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: LF oracle 正确 vs probe 正确 vs 两者重叠（在 gold set 上）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Student exceeds teacher 效应在 gold set 上清晰可见（+6.0pp）。Probe 的增量主要来自 conf=1 区域，\n      即 LF 分歧/缺失的窗口——probe 在这些窗口上的 precision 和 recall 均优于 LF oracle。\n      这证明 probe 从 embedding 中学到了超越 LF 规则的信号，而非简单记忆 LF 输出。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-judge baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet / GPT-4o 做 window-level progress 判断：zero-shot, few-shot, CoT\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_sonnet_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.7452\n      claude_sonnet_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.7891\n      claude_sonnet_cot_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.7289\n      gpt4o_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.7756\n      gpt4o_cot_macro_f1: 0.7943\n      best_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      best_llm_judge_method: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet CoT\"\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: 4.49\n      llm_avg_latency_ms: 2140\n      probe_avg_latency_ms: 3.1\n      speedup_factor: 690\n      llm_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 4.82\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.007\n      cost_ratio: 689\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge 在 zero-shot 下表现中等（~0.73-0.75），因为 window-level progress 判定需要理解多步交互的时序动态，\n      而非单步质量。Few-shot 加 3-5 exemplars 提升 4-5pp，CoT 再提升 2-3pp（让模型显式推理 \"这几步是否推进了目标\"）。\n      最佳配置（Claude Sonnet CoT）达 0.81 macro-F1——合理但非卓越，因为：\n      (a) 长 trajectory windows（5 步 × 平均 800 tokens/step = 4000 tokens context）中模型需要同时理解代码语义和 goal drift，\n      单次 prompt 难以完美捕捉；\n      (b) stagnation 的\"语义多样但集体无效\"模式对 LLM 也构成挑战——模型倾向于给\"看起来在做事\"的 window 标 progress。\n      Probe 的 0.86 F1 优于最佳 LLM 4.5pp，同时推理速度快 690×、成本低 689×。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LLM-as-judge results — model | method | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | latency | cost\"\n      - \"Table: Error overlap — LLM-only errors vs probe-only errors vs shared errors\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto 图: x=cost per 1k windows (log scale), y=macro-F1. Points: MV, Repeat-3, LF oracle, FlyingSquid, mean-pool LR, GRU probe, LLM zero/few/CoT. Probe 在 Pareto 前沿。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge CoT 是最强的非训练 baseline（0.81），但 probe 仍以 +4.5pp 胜出且成本低 3 个数量级。\n      LLM 的主要失败模式：(a) 对\"表面活跃但目标偏离\"的 windows 误判为 progress，(b) 对\"短暂回退后重新聚焦\"的 windows 误判为 stagnation。\n      Probe 通过学习 embedding 空间的 trajectory 模式更好地处理了这些 nuanced cases。\n      Pareto 图清晰显示 probe 严格优于所有 LLM 配置（更高 F1 + 更低 cost）。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-pooling + LR baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"Mean-pooling embeddings + logistic regression/MLP，参数匹配下界\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf2_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.8435\n      conf2_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      conf2_gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      conf2_gru_vs_mlp_gap_pp: 6.13\n      conf1_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7591\n      conf1_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7781\n      conf1_gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf1_gru_vs_mlp_gap_pp: 6.87\n      gold_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7823\n      gold_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7964\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling 丢弃了窗口内 step 顺序信息——对于 progress/stagnation 判定而言，步的顺序至关重要\n      （例如 \"尝试→失败→重试相同\" vs \"尝试→失败→换策略\" 均值 embedding 接近但时序模式截然不同）。\n      MLP 略优于 LR（+1.4pp）因为能学非线性边界，但仍无法建模时序依赖。\n      GRU 在 conf≥2 上 +6.1pp，在全量数据上 +6.9pp——噪声标签下时序建模的优势更大，因为 GRU 可以通过时序一致性隐式去噪。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Temporal vs non-temporal — model | conf≥2 F1 | conf≥1 F1 | gold F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: GRU vs MLP vs LR 在 conf≥2 / conf≥1 / gold set 三个评估集上的 macro-F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRU 的时序建模贡献 +6-7pp，在高噪声场景下优势更大。这支持了\"window-level progress 是时序问题\"的核心 framing。\n\n  - name: \"Error analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_on_gold: 57\n      false_positives: 24\n      false_negatives: 33\n      fp_dominant_pattern: \"exploratory_commands_before_pivot\"\n      fn_dominant_pattern: \"semantic_stagnation_with_diverse_tokens\"\n      fp_by_action_type:\n        file_edit: 8\n        command_exec: 11\n        search_browse: 5\n      fn_by_action_type:\n        file_edit: 14\n        command_exec: 12\n        search_browse: 7\n      fn_overlap_with_lf_errors: 0.42\n      fn_unique_to_probe: 0.58\n      error_rate_by_traj_outcome:\n        resolved: 0.11\n        unresolved: 0.19\n    result_rationale: >\n      FP（24 个）主要是 \"exploratory divergence before productive pivot\"——probe 将短暂的探索性偏离判为 stagnation，\n      但 annotator 认为这是正常 problem-solving 过程。这是 window-level granularity 的固有局限。\n      FN（33 个）主要是 \"semantic stagnation with diverse tokens\"——agent 用不同措辞/工具做本质相同的事，\n      embedding 差异足够大使 probe 判为 progress。这恰好是 probe 未来改进方向。\n      FN 中 58% 是 probe 独有错误（LF oracle 判对），42% 与 LF 共享——probe 在这些案例上未能超越 teacher。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Error breakdown — type | count | dominant pattern | example\"\n      - \"Table: Error rate by trajectory outcome (resolved/unresolved)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap on gold set\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: FP/FN 按 action type 分布\"\n      - \"Example figure: 2 个典型 FP + 2 个典型 FN 的 trajectory 片段 with probe score and LF votes\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析揭示 probe 的核心局限：无法区分 \"productive exploration\" 和 \"aimless wandering\"——两者在 window 级别\n      embedding 相似。FN 中的 \"semantic-diverse stagnation\" 恰好是 LF 也容易遗漏的模式（42% 重叠），\n      说明这是任务本身的难点而非 probe 特有弱点。论文可将此作为 future work 讨论。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-agent transfer (OpenHands)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent 训练的 probe 在 OpenHands 轨迹上 zero-shot 评估，同时评估 LF oracle 迁移\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 312\n      openhands_total_windows: 8934\n      openhands_embedded_windows: 8934\n      probe_cross_macro_f1: 0.7912\n      probe_cross_stag_f1: 0.7384\n      probe_cross_prog_f1: 0.8441\n      lf_oracle_cross_macro_f1: 0.5823\n      lf_oracle_swe_agent_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      lf_oracle_degradation_pp: 21.62\n      probe_degradation_from_swe_pp: 6.71\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_cross_gap_pp: 20.89\n      repeat3_cross_macro_f1: 0.5102\n      cross_agent_lf_adaptation_needed: true\n      lf_command_repetition_cross_f1: 0.4912\n      lf_edit_churn_cross_f1: 0.3845\n      lf_outcome_bp_cross_f1: 0.6234\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe 迁移到 OpenHands（F1=0.79）仅下降 6.7pp——GRU 学到的 progress 信号主要基于 embedding 空间的\n      trajectory 模式（goal-directed movement vs semantic stagnation），这些模式在不同 agent 实现间共享。\n      LF oracle 严重退化（-21.6pp 至 0.58）因为 LFs 编码了 SWE-agent 特定的行为模式：\n      (a) command_repetition 依赖 SWE-agent 的命令格式，OpenHands 的 action space 不同导致 F1=0.49；\n      (b) edit_churn 的文件操作模式不同（OpenHands 更多使用 patch 而非 edit 命令），F1=0.38；\n      (c) outcome_bp 相对稳健（F1=0.62）因为 outcome 信号较通用。\n      这正是论文的核心 claim：probe 学到通用 progress 信号，而 LFs 绑定特定 agent 实现。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-agent results — method | SWE-agent F1 | OpenHands F1 | degradation\"\n      - \"Table: Per-LF cross-agent degradation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Probe vs LF oracle vs Repeat-3 在 SWE-agent vs OpenHands 上的 F1\"\n      - \"t-SNE: OpenHands probe hidden states 着色 by progress/stagnation（应看到与 SWE-agent 类似的簇结构）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 迁移是论文最强的 claim 支撑。Probe 保持 F1=0.79（≥0.75 阈值），\n      而 LF oracle 从 0.80 暴跌至 0.58（-21.6pp ≥ 15pp 阈值）。\n      这证明 probe 学到的是 embedding 空间中的通用 goal-directed progress 信号，\n      而非 SWE-agent 特定的 heuristic patterns。论文 Claim 3 完全成立。\n\n  - name: \"Temporal label model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"HMM-based temporal label model：利用 LF 时序角色（leading/concurrent/lagging）进行时序感知标签聚合\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_type: \"HMM-TLM\"\n      hidden_states: 2\n      transition_prob_pp_to_ss: 0.083\n      transition_prob_ss_to_pp: 0.142\n      emission_learned_roles:\n        command_repetition: \"leading\"\n        edit_churn: \"concurrent\"\n        output_diversity: \"concurrent\"\n        outcome_backpropagation: \"lagging\"\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8413\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.7198\n      temporal_lm_vs_mv_gain_pp: 12.15\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      temporal_lm_vs_flyingsquid_gain_pp: 5.92\n      temporal_lm_conf1_accuracy: 0.79\n      mv_conf1_accuracy: 0.64\n      temporal_lm_label_flip_rate_vs_mv: 0.183\n      temporal_lm_training_converge_epochs: 23\n      bic_vs_static_model: -342.7\n      probe_retrained_on_tlm_gold_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_retrained_on_tlm_conf2_f1: 0.9247\n    result_rationale: >\n      HMM-TLM 的核心优势在于建模状态转移（progress→stagnation 概率 0.083 vs stagnation→progress 0.142），\n      使得在 LF 分歧（conf=1）区域也能利用时序上下文推断标签。\n      MV 在 gold set 上仅 0.72 因为 72% 的 conf=1 窗口只有单个 LF 投票——MV 退化为该 LF 的 precision。\n      FlyingSquid（0.78）通过建模 LF 间相关性改进了 MV，但仍假设 i.i.d.——在序列边界上错误率高。\n      TLM 利用 learned emission priors（如 command_repetition 是 leading indicator → 在 stagnation onset\n      周围 1-2 步窗口内上调其投票权重）将 gold F1 推到 0.84——关键改进来自 stagnation onset/offset 边界\n      附近的窗口，这些恰好是 MV 和 FlyingSquid 错误率最高的区域。\n      BIC 改进 -342.7 证明时序建模不是过拟合。\n      在 TLM 标签上重训练 probe 后 gold F1=0.86（student exceeds teacher：0.86 > 0.84）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Label model comparison on gold set — method | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | label accuracy\"\n      - \"Table: HMM learned parameters — transition probs, emission roles, convergence\"\n      - \"Table: TLM vs MV per-confidence-level accuracy\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"时序可视化: 一条 trajectory 上 MV labels vs TLM labels vs gold labels，标注 LF temporal roles\"\n      - \"HMM state transition diagram with learned probabilities\"\n      - \"Heatmap: TLM label flips relative to MV by position in trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      TLM vs MV +12.15pp（在 [8,15] 范围内），vs FlyingSquid +5.92pp（在 [4,10] 范围内）——两项均清晰显著。\n      改进主要来自 conf=1 区域（TLM 0.79 vs MV 0.64 accuracy），即 LF 分歧窗口。\n      HMM 的状态转移模型隐式编码了 \"stagnation 倾向持续\" 和 \"progress→stagnation 转换是渐进的\" 两个先验，\n      这与 lf-temporal-dynamics 实验发现的 leading/lagging 角色一致。\n      这是论文的核心方法论贡献：证明标准 data programming 在序列数据上可以通过显式建模时序结构获得显著改进。\n\n  - name: \"FlyingSquid baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model baseline，回应 'Why not use a label model?'\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      flyingsquid_conf1_accuracy: 0.71\n      flyingsquid_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 6.23\n      flyingsquid_vs_tlm_gap_pp: -5.92\n      flyingsquid_learned_accuracies:\n        command_repetition: 0.81\n        edit_churn: 0.74\n        output_diversity: 0.69\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.85\n      flyingsquid_learned_correlations: \"cmd_rep ↔ edit_churn: 0.34\"\n      probe_on_fs_labels_gold_f1: 0.8312\n      probe_on_fs_vs_mv_gain_pp: 3.14\n      probe_on_fs_vs_tlm_gap_pp: -2.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过三元组统计估计 LF accuracies 和 pairwise correlations，在 conf=1 区域能利用\n      cross-LF correlation 信息改进标签（0.71 vs MV 0.64）。但它假设 i.i.d.——不知道 command_repetition\n      是 leading indicator（在 stagnation onset 前 1-2 步就亮灯），也不知道 outcome_bp 是 lagging indicator。\n      在 stagnation 边界窗口上 FlyingSquid 的改进有限，因为这些窗口的 LF 投票模式与序列位置强相关——\n      这正是 TLM 的时序建模所捕获的。FlyingSquid 相对 MV +6.2pp 但相对 TLM -5.9pp。\n      在 FlyingSquid 标签上训练的 probe gold F1=0.83——比 MV probe 好但比 TLM probe 差 2.7pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Label model ladder — MV | FlyingSquid | TLM — gold F1 + conf=1 acc + probe downstream F1\"\n      - \"Table: FlyingSquid learned LF accuracies and correlations\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: MV vs FlyingSquid vs TLM 在 gold set 上的 macro-F1，含 error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 作为 \"static correlation-aware label model\" 是 MV 和 TLM 之间的合理中间点。\n      它回答了 reviewer concern：\"为什么不用 label model？\"——答案是\"用了更好的 label model\"，\n      FlyingSquid 改进了 MV 但不如 TLM，因为它缺少时序建模。这形成了清晰的 ablation 阶梯。\n\n  - name: \"Outcome BP sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露分析：占比统计 + hold-out 重训练 + last-N variant\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 0.68\n      exit_context_window_pct: 0.23\n      outcome_bp_only_trigger_pct: 0.089\n      holdout_probe_macro_f1: 0.8978\n      holdout_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.18\n      holdout_gold_macro_f1: 0.8462\n      holdout_gold_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.21\n      last_3_windows_only_bp_f1: 0.9012\n      last_5_windows_only_bp_f1: 0.9034\n      last_3_vs_full_drop_pp: 0.43\n      tlm_holdout_bp_gold_f1: 0.8289\n      tlm_holdout_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.24\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 仅在轨迹末尾的 ~23% 窗口上触发（last 1-3 windows of each trajectory），\n      且仅 8.9% 的窗口是 outcome_bp 唯一投票者（即 outcome_bp 是 tie-breaker 的场景很少）。\n      Hold-out outcome_bp 后 probe F1 仅下降 1.18pp（conf≥2 上）和 1.21pp（gold set 上），\n      因为 outcome_bp 的信号与其他 LFs 高度相关——特别是 command_repetition 在 stagnation 结束前\n      已经停止触发（leading indicator），outcome_bp 是 lagging confirmation 而非独立新信息。\n      Last-N-windows-only variant（仅在最后 3/5 个窗口上使用 BP）几乎无性能变化（-0.43pp），\n      进一步证明 BP 不是 \"从未来偷信息\" 而是 \"确认其他 LFs 已暗示的趋势\"。\n      TLM 在 hold-out BP 后 gold F1 下降 1.24pp，同样在 2pp 阈值内。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Outcome BP coverage — metric | value\"\n      - \"Table: Hold-out sensitivity — condition | conf≥2 F1 | gold F1 | drop\"\n      - \"Table: Last-N-only variant — N | F1 | drop\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 每个 LF 在 stagnation/progress windows 上的触发率，标注 outcome_bp 的占比\"\n      - \"Line chart: hold-out outcome_bp 前后 probe 在 trajectory 不同位置上的 F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      泄露可忽略。Hold-out drop 1.18-1.21pp 远低于 2pp 阈值。核心原因是 outcome_bp 作为 lagging indicator\n      提供的信息被其他 LFs 的 leading/concurrent signals 大量冗余覆盖。\n      Last-N variant 进一步表明即使限制 BP 到轨迹末尾，信号损失极小。\n      论文可自信 claim：outcome_bp 不构成信息泄露，TLM 中它作为 lagging role 被适当加权。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 消融实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Window size ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7 窗口大小消融\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.8812\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.9134\n      k3_stag_f1: 0.8195\n      k5_stag_f1: 0.8724\n      k7_stag_f1: 0.8703\n      k3_latency_ms: 1.9\n      k5_latency_ms: 3.1\n      k7_latency_ms: 4.8\n      optimal_k: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3 信号积累不足——3 步窗口内 stagnation 和短暂 hesitation 难以区分（stag-F1 下降 5.3pp）。\n      k=5 是 sweet spot：足够长以捕获 progress/stagnation 的时序签名，但不至于跨越 stagnation onset/offset 边界\n      而模糊信号。k=7 略低于 k=5（-0.5pp），因为过长窗口混入 transition 区域（前 3 步 progress + 后 4 步 stagnation\n      的窗口被标为 stagnation，但 GRU 从前半段提取到 progress 信号导致混淆）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Window size sweep — k | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | latency\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: macro-F1 vs k (3,5,7), 含 stagnation-F1 和 progress-F1 子曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5 是最优窗口大小，k=3 和 k=7 均有少量退化但 pattern 不同（k=3 检测力不足，k=7 信号模糊）。\n      论文报告 k=5 作为 default 并展示消融表。\n\n  - name: \"Architecture ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.9023\n      transformer_4layer_macro_f1: 0.9078\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      gru_attention_params: 847362\n      transformer_params: 2134528\n      gru_attention_vs_meanpool_gap_pp: 1.62\n      gru_attention_vs_transformer_gap_pp: 1.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention（默认配置）最优，因为 attention 允许模型在 stagnation onset 附近的关键 step 上\n      集中权重——这与 temporal label model 发现的 leading indicator 机制一致。\n      GRU+mean-pool 下降 1.6pp——mean-pooling 丢失了窗口内位置信息。\n      Transformer 4-layer 接近但略低（-1.1pp），且参数量 2.5× 大于 GRU——在 5-step 短序列上\n      self-attention 相对 recurrent 没有明显优势，且更容易过拟合。\n      MLP on pooled 最差（0.857），与 baseline-meanpool-lr 一致，证明时序建模是核心增量。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture comparison — arch | macro-F1 | params | latency\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 4 architectures 在 macro-F1, stag-F1, prog-F1, latency, params 上的对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择不是论文 novelty——GRU+attention 是合理的工程选择。消融证明时序建模（GRU）是关键（+6pp vs MLP），\n      attention 提供小幅增量（+1.6pp）。论文降权架构讨论，将 novelty 锚定在 temporal label model。\n\n  - name: \"LF hold-one-out ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个 LF 重新训练 temporal label model + probe，量化各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_model_gold_f1: 0.8583\n      holdout_command_repetition_gold_f1: 0.8198\n      holdout_edit_churn_gold_f1: 0.8367\n      holdout_output_diversity_gold_f1: 0.8451\n      holdout_outcome_bp_gold_f1: 0.8462\n      marginal_command_repetition_pp: 3.85\n      marginal_edit_churn_pp: 2.16\n      marginal_output_diversity_pp: 1.32\n      marginal_outcome_bp_pp: 1.21\n      holdout_all_except_cmd_rep_f1: 0.7845\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition 贡献最大（-3.85pp when held out），因为它是 stagnation 的最直接信号\n      （agent 反复执行相似命令）且是 leading indicator——在 stagnation onset 最先触发，\n      temporal label model 赋予它高权重。edit_churn 第二（-2.16pp），覆盖 command_repetition\n      未捕获的 \"编辑同一文件不同位置\" 模式。output_diversity 和 outcome_bp 边际贡献较小（1-1.3pp），\n      因为它们的信号与前两个 LFs 有较高冗余（尤其 outcome_bp 作为 lagging indicator 被其他 LFs 先行覆盖）。\n      仅保留 command_repetition 时 F1=0.78——单 LF 仍有效但不够。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF hold-one-out — held-out LF | gold F1 | drop | rank\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 从 full model F1 到 hold-one-out 的各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    analysis: >\n      4 个 LFs 均有正边际贡献，command_repetition 最重要。这支持了 temporal label model 中\n      对 leading indicator 的加权——贡献最大的 LF 恰好是 leading indicator。\n      且没有任何单一 LF 的 hold-out 导致 F1 低于 0.82，说明 LFs 间有健康的信号冗余。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon auxiliary loss ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无 supervised contrastive loss 对 F1 和 embedding 分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9247\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      supcon_gain_pp: 0.62\n      with_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.71\n      without_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      supcon_weight: 0.1\n      supcon_temperature: 0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon 辅助损失（weight=0.1）对 F1 的直接增量很小（+0.62pp），但对 hidden state 的几何结构\n      影响显著（silhouette score 0.71 vs 0.58）。这是因为 SupCon 鼓励同类样本在 hidden space 中聚拢、\n      异类分离，使 decision boundary 更 robust——但由于 GRU+CE loss 已经足够强，F1 增量有限。\n      主要价值在 interpretability：更清晰的 embedding 分离使 t-SNE 可视化更直观。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: SupCon ablation — condition | macro-F1 | silhouette | intra-class dist | inter-class dist\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side t-SNE: with vs without SupCon 的 hidden state 分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 对 F1 贡献有限但改善 embedding 质量。论文可将其作为 optional enhancement 报告。\n      不是论文的 key contribution——如果空间紧张可放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP structural baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征（行数改动、命令类型、test counts）分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.6823\n      structural_gbdt_macro_f1: 0.7245\n      structural_features_count: 18\n      structural_best_features: [\"lines_changed_std\", \"unique_commands_ratio\", \"test_run_count\"]\n      nlp_probe_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      nlp_vs_structural_gap_pp: 19.40\n      combined_structural_plus_nlp_macro_f1: 0.9201\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征（行数改动方差、唯一命令比例、测试执行次数等 18 维）在 GBDT 上达到 0.72——\n      证明 structural signals 有一定判别力（特别是 \"lines_changed_std\" 捕获重复编辑模式），\n      但远逊于 NL embedding probe（-19.4pp）。这是因为结构特征无法捕获语义层面的信息：\n      \"修改了 10 行\" 不区分 \"修了一个 bug\" 和 \"做了无效修改又撤销\"。\n      结构+NL 结合（0.92）几乎无增量（+0.16pp），说明 NL embedding 已涵盖结构信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Feature set comparison — features | model | macro-F1\"\n      - \"Table: Top-5 structural feature importances\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: structural vs NL vs combined\"\n    analysis: >\n      NL embedding 必要且充分。纯结构 baseline 0.72 远低于 probe 0.92——\n      证明 progress/stagnation 判定需要理解 action 语义而非仅计数。\n      这强化了论文在 NLP venue 的 fit：NL 是解决此问题的核心。\n\n  - name: \"Encoder ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE 对 probe 性能的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_06b_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      bge_m3_macro_f1: 0.9034\n      e5_large_macro_f1: 0.8978\n      gte_base_macro_f1: 0.8845\n      qwen3_embed_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_embed_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      gte_base_embed_dim: 768\n      qwen3_vs_worst_gap_pp: 3.40\n      encoding_time_per_window_ms:\n        qwen3: 35\n        bge_m3: 38\n        e5_large: 42\n        gte_base: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 最优（0.9185）因为它在 code-related text 上的预训练数据更丰富——\n      agent trajectories 包含大量代码片段和命令行输出，这是 Qwen3 的优势领域。\n      BGE-M3 紧随其后（-1.5pp），E5-large（-2.1pp）和 GTE（-3.4pp）依次下降。\n      但最差的 GTE 仍达 0.88——说明 probe 对 encoder 选择有中等敏感度但不脆弱。\n      方差 3.4pp 表明 encoder 质量有影响但不是 make-or-break factor。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Encoder comparison — encoder | dim | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | encoding time\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 encoders 的 macro-F1 排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      Encoder 选择有影响但 probe 方法 robust——最差 encoder 仍 0.88。\n      论文用 Qwen3 作为 default 并在 appendix 报告消融。\n      这回应了 reviewer concern \"embedding model unspecified\"——具名 + 消融。\n\n  - name: \"Human annotation gold set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口 3-annotator 人工标注，Fleiss κ，重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 412\n      annotator_count: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.823\n      majority_agreement_pct: 0.91\n      unanimous_agreement_pct: 0.74\n      gold_label_distribution:\n        progress: 248\n        stagnation: 164\n      inter_annotator_disagreement_patterns: \"主要分歧在 transition 窗口（stagnation onset/offset ±1 步）\"\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.7198\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8413\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      probe_on_mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.8312\n      probe_on_tlm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      llm_judge_cot_gold_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      repeat3_gold_macro_f1: 0.5891\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.7823\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.82 属 \"almost perfect agreement\" 范围——progress/stagnation 在窗口级别是 annotators\n      可靠标注的任务（不像 step-level 需要细粒度判断）。74% 全体一致，91% 多数一致。\n      分歧主要在 transition 窗口——stagnation 刚开始或刚结束的 1-2 个窗口，annotators 对 \"还在探索\"\n      vs \"已经卡住\" 的判断不同。这正是 temporal label model 改进最大的区域。\n      Gold set 上所有方法的排序与论文 narrative 完美一致：TLM probe (0.86) > LLM CoT (0.81) > LF oracle (0.80)\n      > FlyingSquid (0.78) > mean-pool (0.78) > MV (0.72) > Repeat-3 (0.59)。\n      破解了 circular evaluation concern——所有数字都在 human labels 上重新评估。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Gold set — all methods ranked by macro-F1 on human annotations\"\n      - \"Table: Inter-annotator agreement — κ, agreement %, disagreement patterns\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 所有方法在 gold set 上的 macro-F1 排序\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix: annotator 间的 label agreement heatmap\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.82 在 [0.75, 0.90] 范围内，gold set 评估可信。所有 claims 在 human labels 上验证通过：\n      (1) TLM > MV +12.15pp, TLM > FS +5.92pp；\n      (2) Probe > LF oracle +5.98pp (student exceeds teacher)；\n      (3) Probe > LLM CoT +4.49pp (cost-accuracy Pareto)。\n      Gold set 是论文最关键的 contribution——将整个评估从自动标签上移到人工标注上。\n\n  - name: \"LF temporal dynamics analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后的触发时序：leading vs concurrent vs lagging\"\n    expected_results:\n      stagnation_onset_windows_analyzed: 3847\n      command_repetition_mean_offset: -1.82\n      command_repetition_offset_std: 0.94\n      command_repetition_role: \"leading\"\n      edit_churn_mean_offset: -0.34\n      edit_churn_offset_std: 1.21\n      edit_churn_role: \"concurrent\"\n      output_diversity_mean_offset: 0.12\n      output_diversity_offset_std: 1.08\n      output_diversity_role: \"concurrent\"\n      outcome_bp_mean_offset: 2.13\n      outcome_bp_offset_std: 1.45\n      outcome_bp_role: \"lagging\"\n      offset_significance_p_values:\n        command_repetition: 0.00003\n        edit_churn: 0.14\n        output_diversity: 0.38\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.00001\n      granger_causality_cmd_rep_to_stag_p: 0.002\n      mutual_information_lf_pairs:\n        cmd_rep_edit_churn: 0.28\n        cmd_rep_outcome_bp: 0.15\n        edit_churn_output_div: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 3,847 个 stagnation onset 窗口上对齐分析：\n      command_repetition 平均在 onset 前 1.82 步开始触发（leading，p<0.001）——\n      agent 在完全陷入 stagnation 前就开始出现命令重复的早期信号。\n      edit_churn 和 output_diversity 与 onset 基本同步（offset ≈ 0，p>0.1，concurrent）。\n      outcome_bp 平均在 onset 后 2.13 步才触发（lagging，p<0.001）——\n      因为 outcome 信息需要轨迹进一步推进才能\"回传\"到当前窗口判定。\n      Granger causality 测试证实 command_repetition → stagnation onset 存在预测关系（p=0.002）。\n      这些发现直接构成 temporal label model 的实证基础——知道了哪个 LF 领先/滞后，\n      就能在标签聚合时做时序加权而非 naive 等权投票。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF temporal roles — LF | mean offset | std | role | p-value\"\n      - \"Table: Granger causality and mutual information between LF pairs\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"时序图: stagnation onset 对齐（t=0），各 LF 触发概率 vs time offset（-5 到 +5 步）\"\n      - \"Heatmap: LF pair mutual information matrix\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF 时序动态是 temporal label model 的实证基础——如果 LFs 没有显著的 leading/lagging 差异，\n      temporal label model 就退化为 FlyingSquid。但实验清晰证明 command_repetition leads by ~1.8 steps\n      且 outcome_bp lags by ~2.1 steps（均 p<0.001）——i.i.d. 假设确实被违反，且违反方式是有结构的。\n      这支撑了论文 Claim 1 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 扩展实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data scaling curve\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据 → probe F1 曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct_10_macro_f1: 0.8234\n      pct_25_macro_f1: 0.8712\n      pct_50_macro_f1: 0.9023\n      pct_100_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      pct_10_n_windows: 1540\n      pct_25_n_windows: 3850\n      pct_50_n_windows: 7700\n      pct_100_n_windows: 15401\n      diminishing_returns_knee: \"~40%\"\n      pct_50_vs_100_gap_pp: 1.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      10% 数据（1,540 windows）probe 已达 0.82——GRU 在少量高质量标签上也能学到基本的 progress/stagnation 分界。\n      25% 提升到 0.87，50% 达 0.90——收益递减拐点约在 40%（~6,000 windows）。\n      50% → 100% 仅提升 1.6pp，表明 15K windows 已接近 conf≥2 子集的信息饱和。\n      这对实际部署有价值：不需要完整数据集也能获得 >90% 的性能。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Data scaling — pct | n_windows | macro-F1 | stag-F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x=training data pct (log scale), y=macro-F1, with 95% CI bands\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 数据效率较高——50% 数据达 98% 性能。论文报告此结果以指导实际标注预算。\n      放 appendix 即可，不是核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Early termination simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在 held-out 轨迹上模拟基于 probe 预测的 early termination，计算 tokens saved vs success rate\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_held_out_trajectories: 487\n      terminate_after_3_consecutive_stag:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 31.2\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 94.7\n        false_termination_rate: 0.053\n      terminate_after_5_consecutive_stag:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 22.8\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 97.9\n        false_termination_rate: 0.021\n      optimal_threshold: \"4 consecutive stagnation windows\"\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 27.4\n      optimal_success_preserved_pct: 96.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 487 条 held-out 轨迹上模拟：当 probe 连续 N 个窗口预测 stagnation 时 terminate。\n      N=3 较激进——节省 31% tokens 但 5.3% 的成功轨迹被误杀（false termination）。\n      N=5 较保守——节省 23% tokens，false termination 仅 2.1%。\n      N=4 是最佳平衡点——27% tokens saved，96.8% success preserved，false termination 3.2%。\n      节省的 tokens 主要来自 \"长尾 stagnation\"——agent 在最后 10+ 步完全卡住但继续尝试直到 token limit。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Termination threshold sweep — N | tokens saved % | success preserved % | false term %\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved vs success rate preserved, 标注 N=3,4,5\"\n      - \"Histogram: terminated 轨迹的 remaining tokens 分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination 是 probe 的直接应用价值——在不显著影响成功率的前提下节省 27% tokens。\n      论文放 discussion/application 章节，不是核心 claim 但增加实用性。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"t-SNE/UMAP 可视化 GRU hidden states + attention weight 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.63\n      attention_peak_at_stag_onset: true\n      attention_weight_first_step_mean: 0.14\n      attention_weight_last_step_mean: 0.28\n      attention_weight_max_step_mean: 0.31\n      cluster_purity_progress: 0.89\n      cluster_purity_stagnation: 0.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hidden states 在 t-SNE/UMAP 上形成两个主要簇（progress/stagnation），但有重叠区域（silhouette=0.58-0.63）——\n      重叠主要来自 transition 窗口。SupCon 版本簇更紧致（silhouette=0.71）。\n      Attention weights 在窗口的后半段集中（last 2 steps 占 ~59% attention weight），\n      尤其在 stagnation onset 窗口上 attention 集中在第 4-5 步（模型关注 \"重复模式确认\" 的时刻）。\n      这与 leading indicator 分析一致：模型需要看到足够的步才能确认 stagnation 模式。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Attention weight distribution — step position | mean weight | std\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE scatter: hidden states colored by label, shaped by conf level\"\n      - \"UMAP scatter: same data, alternative projection\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 20 example windows, 5 steps × attention weight, sorted by predicted stag probability\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化提供直觉支持：(a) hidden states 形成可分的簇结构，(b) attention 集中在后步——\n      模型等待足够证据才做判断。论文放 qualitative analysis 章节，辅助 reviewers 理解模型行为。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12614,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12614},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c96712c-1f0d-4f76-a0a8-e9fe3e229a01","uuid":"9bfe2a59-2588-49a8-a82e-a8cefc8e73c7"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":371041,"duration_api_ms":372259,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Temporal label model 作为对 data programming 在序列数据上的方法论贡献立得住——\n  i.i.d. 假设违反问题有实证（lf-temporal-dynamics）、有解法（temporal-label-model）、有显著增益（+12pp vs MV, +6pp vs FlyingSquid）。\n  三层贡献链完整：temporal label model 提升标签质量 → probe 在 temporal LM 标签上训练后超越 LF oracle（student exceeds teacher）→\n  cross-agent 迁移验证 probe 学到通用 progress 信号而非 agent-specific heuristics。\n  outcome_bp 泄露可忽略（hold-out 仅 -1.2pp），human gold set κ=0.82 确保评估可信。\n  Headline: \"Temporal label model improves label quality by 12pp over MV on human gold set;\n  ProgressProbe achieves 0.86 macro-F1, outperforming LF oracle by +6pp and LLM-as-Judge (CoT) by +5pp while being 700× faster.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0 核心实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed stability verification\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"3 seeds (42,123,456) 训练 GRU probe on conf≥2, 报告 mean±std macro-F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.9275\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9224\n      mean_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      std_macro_f1: 0.0113\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp: true\n      repeat3_baseline_range: \"0.62-0.84\"\n      paired_ttest_p_vs_repeat3: 0.008\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf≥2 子集（15,401 windows）标签质量高（至少 2 个 LF 一致），GRU 有足够信号学到稳定的 progress/stagnation 分界。\n      std=0.011 反映初始化和 mini-batch 随机性的正常波动范围，不改变 vs Repeat-3 的显著性结论。\n      seed 42（0.9055）略低因恰好某些困难 stagnation 样本分到 test set，但 gap 仍 >5pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Per-seed results — seed | macro-F1 | acc | stagnation-F1 | progress-F1 | gap vs Repeat-3\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 3 seeds 的 macro-F1 分布 vs Repeat-3 baseline 分布，whisker 表示 seed 间变异\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计稳定性成立。mean=0.9185±0.011 macro-F1 在所有 seeds 上均显著优于 Repeat-3（最坏 seed 仍 +6.2pp）。\n      paired t-test p=0.008 < 0.01。可在论文中报告 mean±std 而非 cherry-pick 单 seed。\n\n  - name: \"CosineSim baseline diagnostic\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"排查 CosineSim baseline 0.3129 是否合理：threshold sweep、分数分布分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      default_threshold: 0.5\n      optimal_threshold: 0.72\n      cosinesim_at_optimal: 0.5834\n      score_distribution_mean: 0.68\n      score_distribution_std: 0.11\n      ks_test_progress_vs_stagnation_p: 0.003\n      overlap_coefficient: 0.61\n    result_rationale: >\n      CosineSim 比较相邻 step embeddings 的余弦相似度——progress windows 中连续 steps 语义变化大（低相似度），\n      stagnation 中步间相似度高。但实际分布高度重叠（overlap=0.61），因为 progress 中也有局部相似操作（如连续 file edits），\n      stagnation 中也有表面多样性（语义等价但 token 不同的命令）。默认 threshold=0.5 远低于分布中心 0.68，\n      导致大量 windows 被判为 stagnation，F1 崩到 0.31。优化 threshold 后提升到 0.58 但仍远逊于 GRU，\n      证明单步余弦相似度无法捕获 window-level 的时序 progress 模式。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Threshold sweep — threshold | precision | recall | F1 (stagnation) | macro-F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: progress vs stagnation windows 的 mean cosine similarity 分布（双峰但大量重叠）\"\n      - \"ROC curve: CosineSim 的 AUC vs random baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      0.3129 是合理的——CosineSim 在默认 threshold 下 precision 尚可但 recall 极低。\n      即使 threshold 优化后仍仅 0.58，证明 step-pair 余弦相似度无法捕获 window-level progress 信号。\n      保留作为 \"naive embedding baseline\" 的下界。\n\n  - name: \"Full-data training (conf≥1)\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量 54,809 windows（含 conf=1 噪声标签）训练 GRU probe，对比 conf≥2\"\n    expected_results:\n      test_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      test_accuracy: 0.8785\n      test_f1_stagnation: 0.7772\n      test_f1_progress: 0.9165\n      vs_probe001_delta_pp: -5.87\n      conf1_noise_rate_estimated: 0.22\n      best_baseline_repeat3: 0.6104\n      probe_vs_repeat3_gap_pp: 23.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1 窗口（39,408 个，占 72%）仅有单个 LF 投票，预估噪声率 ~22%。GRU 的时序建模能力可以部分容忍噪声标签\n      （vs mean-pool 在全量数据上退化更严重：-12.7pp），但 macro-F1 仍下降 5.87pp。\n      关键观察：stagnation-F1 受影响更大（-8.2pp vs progress-F1 -3.5pp），因为 conf=1 中 stagnation 标签\n      更容易被错标为 progress（LF 漏报 stagnation 多于误报 stagnation）。\n      Repeat-3 在全量测试集上仅 0.61（vs conf≥2 上 0.84），因为 conf=1 窗口的 stagnation 模式更多样化，简单重复检测失效。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: conf≥1 vs conf≥2 — metric | conf≥2 (probe-001) | conf≥1 (probe-002) | delta\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 按 conf level 分层的 probe F1 vs baselines\"\n    analysis: >\n      全量训练 F1 下降 5.87pp 证实标签质量对 probe 性能有直接影响——这正是 temporal label model 的动机。\n      conf=1 区域的噪声标签是 MV 的主要瓶颈，temporal label model 的改进空间集中在此。\n      同时 probe 在全量数据上仍以 +23.65pp 大幅超越 Repeat-3，表明即使标签有噪声，GRU 仍能学到有用信号。\n\n  - name: \"LF ensemble oracle baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用 LF 实时输出的多数投票做窗口级判定（推理时可用的上界），对比 probe\"\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_conf_ge2_macro_f1: 0.8821\n      oracle_conf_ge1_macro_f1: 0.7203\n      oracle_gold_set_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      probe_gold_set_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_vs_oracle_gold_gap_pp: 5.98\n      oracle_conf1_abstain_rate: 0.0\n      oracle_conf1_accuracy: 0.64\n      oracle_coverage: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 conf≥2 上 F1=0.88——接近 probe 的 0.91——因为高置信区域 LF 本身准确。\n      但在 conf=1 区域（72% 的数据）LF oracle 仅 0.64 accuracy（单 LF 投票 = 该 LF 的 precision），\n      加权后全量 F1 跌至 0.72。在 gold set 上 F1=0.80 因为 gold set 抽样偏向边界案例。\n      Probe 在 gold set 上 0.86 优于 oracle 6pp——\"student exceeds teacher\" 成立，因为 GRU 从 embedding\n      中学到了 LF 未编码的语义信号（如渐进式目标偏离、命令语义等价但 token 不同）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF oracle vs probe — evaluation set | LF oracle F1 | probe F1 | gap\"\n      - \"Table: LF oracle per-LF accuracy on gold set\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: LF oracle 正确 vs probe 正确 vs 两者重叠（在 gold set 上）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Student exceeds teacher 效应在 gold set 上清晰可见（+6.0pp）。Probe 的增量主要来自 conf=1 区域，\n      即 LF 分歧/缺失的窗口——probe 在这些窗口上的 precision 和 recall 均优于 LF oracle。\n      这证明 probe 从 embedding 中学到了超越 LF 规则的信号，而非简单记忆 LF 输出。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-judge baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet / GPT-4o 做 window-level progress 判断：zero-shot, few-shot, CoT\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_sonnet_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.7452\n      claude_sonnet_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.7891\n      claude_sonnet_cot_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.7289\n      gpt4o_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.7756\n      gpt4o_cot_macro_f1: 0.7943\n      best_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      best_llm_judge_method: \"Claude-3.5-Sonnet CoT\"\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: 4.49\n      llm_avg_latency_ms: 2140\n      probe_avg_latency_ms: 3.1\n      speedup_factor: 690\n      llm_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 4.82\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.007\n      cost_ratio: 689\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge 在 zero-shot 下表现中等（~0.73-0.75），因为 window-level progress 判定需要理解多步交互的时序动态，\n      而非单步质量。Few-shot 加 3-5 exemplars 提升 4-5pp，CoT 再提升 2-3pp（让模型显式推理 \"这几步是否推进了目标\"）。\n      最佳配置（Claude Sonnet CoT）达 0.81 macro-F1——合理但非卓越，因为：\n      (a) 长 trajectory windows（5 步 × 平均 800 tokens/step = 4000 tokens context）中模型需要同时理解代码语义和 goal drift，\n      单次 prompt 难以完美捕捉；\n      (b) stagnation 的\"语义多样但集体无效\"模式对 LLM 也构成挑战——模型倾向于给\"看起来在做事\"的 window 标 progress。\n      Probe 的 0.86 F1 优于最佳 LLM 4.5pp，同时推理速度快 690×、成本低 689×。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LLM-as-judge results — model | method | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | latency | cost\"\n      - \"Table: Error overlap — LLM-only errors vs probe-only errors vs shared errors\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto 图: x=cost per 1k windows (log scale), y=macro-F1. Points: MV, Repeat-3, LF oracle, FlyingSquid, mean-pool LR, GRU probe, LLM zero/few/CoT. Probe 在 Pareto 前沿。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge CoT 是最强的非训练 baseline（0.81），但 probe 仍以 +4.5pp 胜出且成本低 3 个数量级。\n      LLM 的主要失败模式：(a) 对\"表面活跃但目标偏离\"的 windows 误判为 progress，(b) 对\"短暂回退后重新聚焦\"的 windows 误判为 stagnation。\n      Probe 通过学习 embedding 空间的 trajectory 模式更好地处理了这些 nuanced cases。\n      Pareto 图清晰显示 probe 严格优于所有 LLM 配置（更高 F1 + 更低 cost）。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-pooling + LR baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"Mean-pooling embeddings + logistic regression/MLP，参数匹配下界\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf2_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.8435\n      conf2_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      conf2_gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      conf2_gru_vs_mlp_gap_pp: 6.13\n      conf1_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7591\n      conf1_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7781\n      conf1_gru_probe_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf1_gru_vs_mlp_gap_pp: 6.87\n      gold_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7823\n      gold_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7964\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling 丢弃了窗口内 step 顺序信息——对于 progress/stagnation 判定而言，步的顺序至关重要\n      （例如 \"尝试→失败→重试相同\" vs \"尝试→失败→换策略\" 均值 embedding 接近但时序模式截然不同）。\n      MLP 略优于 LR（+1.4pp）因为能学非线性边界，但仍无法建模时序依赖。\n      GRU 在 conf≥2 上 +6.1pp，在全量数据上 +6.9pp——噪声标签下时序建模的优势更大，因为 GRU 可以通过时序一致性隐式去噪。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Temporal vs non-temporal — model | conf≥2 F1 | conf≥1 F1 | gold F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: GRU vs MLP vs LR 在 conf≥2 / conf≥1 / gold set 三个评估集上的 macro-F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRU 的时序建模贡献 +6-7pp，在高噪声场景下优势更大。这支持了\"window-level progress 是时序问题\"的核心 framing。\n\n  - name: \"Error analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_on_gold: 57\n      false_positives: 24\n      false_negatives: 33\n      fp_dominant_pattern: \"exploratory_commands_before_pivot\"\n      fn_dominant_pattern: \"semantic_stagnation_with_diverse_tokens\"\n      fp_by_action_type:\n        file_edit: 8\n        command_exec: 11\n        search_browse: 5\n      fn_by_action_type:\n        file_edit: 14\n        command_exec: 12\n        search_browse: 7\n      fn_overlap_with_lf_errors: 0.42\n      fn_unique_to_probe: 0.58\n      error_rate_by_traj_outcome:\n        resolved: 0.11\n        unresolved: 0.19\n    result_rationale: >\n      FP（24 个）主要是 \"exploratory divergence before productive pivot\"——probe 将短暂的探索性偏离判为 stagnation，\n      但 annotator 认为这是正常 problem-solving 过程。这是 window-level granularity 的固有局限。\n      FN（33 个）主要是 \"semantic stagnation with diverse tokens\"——agent 用不同措辞/工具做本质相同的事，\n      embedding 差异足够大使 probe 判为 progress。这恰好是 probe 未来改进方向。\n      FN 中 58% 是 probe 独有错误（LF oracle 判对），42% 与 LF 共享——probe 在这些案例上未能超越 teacher。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Error breakdown — type | count | dominant pattern | example\"\n      - \"Table: Error rate by trajectory outcome (resolved/unresolved)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap on gold set\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: FP/FN 按 action type 分布\"\n      - \"Example figure: 2 个典型 FP + 2 个典型 FN 的 trajectory 片段 with probe score and LF votes\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析揭示 probe 的核心局限：无法区分 \"productive exploration\" 和 \"aimless wandering\"——两者在 window 级别\n      embedding 相似。FN 中的 \"semantic-diverse stagnation\" 恰好是 LF 也容易遗漏的模式（42% 重叠），\n      说明这是任务本身的难点而非 probe 特有弱点。论文可将此作为 future work 讨论。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-agent transfer (OpenHands)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent 训练的 probe 在 OpenHands 轨迹上 zero-shot 评估，同时评估 LF oracle 迁移\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 312\n      openhands_total_windows: 8934\n      openhands_embedded_windows: 8934\n      probe_cross_macro_f1: 0.7912\n      probe_cross_stag_f1: 0.7384\n      probe_cross_prog_f1: 0.8441\n      lf_oracle_cross_macro_f1: 0.5823\n      lf_oracle_swe_agent_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      lf_oracle_degradation_pp: 21.62\n      probe_degradation_from_swe_pp: 6.71\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_cross_gap_pp: 20.89\n      repeat3_cross_macro_f1: 0.5102\n      cross_agent_lf_adaptation_needed: true\n      lf_command_repetition_cross_f1: 0.4912\n      lf_edit_churn_cross_f1: 0.3845\n      lf_outcome_bp_cross_f1: 0.6234\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe 迁移到 OpenHands（F1=0.79）仅下降 6.7pp——GRU 学到的 progress 信号主要基于 embedding 空间的\n      trajectory 模式（goal-directed movement vs semantic stagnation），这些模式在不同 agent 实现间共享。\n      LF oracle 严重退化（-21.6pp 至 0.58）因为 LFs 编码了 SWE-agent 特定的行为模式：\n      (a) command_repetition 依赖 SWE-agent 的命令格式，OpenHands 的 action space 不同导致 F1=0.49；\n      (b) edit_churn 的文件操作模式不同（OpenHands 更多使用 patch 而非 edit 命令），F1=0.38；\n      (c) outcome_bp 相对稳健（F1=0.62）因为 outcome 信号较通用。\n      这正是论文的核心 claim：probe 学到通用 progress 信号，而 LFs 绑定特定 agent 实现。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-agent results — method | SWE-agent F1 | OpenHands F1 | degradation\"\n      - \"Table: Per-LF cross-agent degradation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Probe vs LF oracle vs Repeat-3 在 SWE-agent vs OpenHands 上的 F1\"\n      - \"t-SNE: OpenHands probe hidden states 着色 by progress/stagnation（应看到与 SWE-agent 类似的簇结构）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 迁移是论文最强的 claim 支撑。Probe 保持 F1=0.79（≥0.75 阈值），\n      而 LF oracle 从 0.80 暴跌至 0.58（-21.6pp ≥ 15pp 阈值）。\n      这证明 probe 学到的是 embedding 空间中的通用 goal-directed progress 信号，\n      而非 SWE-agent 特定的 heuristic patterns。论文 Claim 3 完全成立。\n\n  - name: \"Temporal label model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"HMM-based temporal label model：利用 LF 时序角色（leading/concurrent/lagging）进行时序感知标签聚合\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_type: \"HMM-TLM\"\n      hidden_states: 2\n      transition_prob_pp_to_ss: 0.083\n      transition_prob_ss_to_pp: 0.142\n      emission_learned_roles:\n        command_repetition: \"leading\"\n        edit_churn: \"concurrent\"\n        output_diversity: \"concurrent\"\n        outcome_backpropagation: \"lagging\"\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8413\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.7198\n      temporal_lm_vs_mv_gain_pp: 12.15\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      temporal_lm_vs_flyingsquid_gain_pp: 5.92\n      temporal_lm_conf1_accuracy: 0.79\n      mv_conf1_accuracy: 0.64\n      temporal_lm_label_flip_rate_vs_mv: 0.183\n      temporal_lm_training_converge_epochs: 23\n      bic_vs_static_model: -342.7\n      probe_retrained_on_tlm_gold_f1: 0.8583\n      probe_retrained_on_tlm_conf2_f1: 0.9247\n    result_rationale: >\n      HMM-TLM 的核心优势在于建模状态转移（progress→stagnation 概率 0.083 vs stagnation→progress 0.142），\n      使得在 LF 分歧（conf=1）区域也能利用时序上下文推断标签。\n      MV 在 gold set 上仅 0.72 因为 72% 的 conf=1 窗口只有单个 LF 投票——MV 退化为该 LF 的 precision。\n      FlyingSquid（0.78）通过建模 LF 间相关性改进了 MV，但仍假设 i.i.d.——在序列边界上错误率高。\n      TLM 利用 learned emission priors（如 command_repetition 是 leading indicator → 在 stagnation onset\n      周围 1-2 步窗口内上调其投票权重）将 gold F1 推到 0.84——关键改进来自 stagnation onset/offset 边界\n      附近的窗口，这些恰好是 MV 和 FlyingSquid 错误率最高的区域。\n      BIC 改进 -342.7 证明时序建模不是过拟合。\n      在 TLM 标签上重训练 probe 后 gold F1=0.86（student exceeds teacher：0.86 > 0.84）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Label model comparison on gold set — method | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | label accuracy\"\n      - \"Table: HMM learned parameters — transition probs, emission roles, convergence\"\n      - \"Table: TLM vs MV per-confidence-level accuracy\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"时序可视化: 一条 trajectory 上 MV labels vs TLM labels vs gold labels，标注 LF temporal roles\"\n      - \"HMM state transition diagram with learned probabilities\"\n      - \"Heatmap: TLM label flips relative to MV by position in trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      TLM vs MV +12.15pp（在 [8,15] 范围内），vs FlyingSquid +5.92pp（在 [4,10] 范围内）——两项均清晰显著。\n      改进主要来自 conf=1 区域（TLM 0.79 vs MV 0.64 accuracy），即 LF 分歧窗口。\n      HMM 的状态转移模型隐式编码了 \"stagnation 倾向持续\" 和 \"progress→stagnation 转换是渐进的\" 两个先验，\n      这与 lf-temporal-dynamics 实验发现的 leading/lagging 角色一致。\n      这是论文的核心方法论贡献：证明标准 data programming 在序列数据上可以通过显式建模时序结构获得显著改进。\n\n  - name: \"FlyingSquid baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model baseline，回应 'Why not use a label model?'\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      flyingsquid_conf1_accuracy: 0.71\n      flyingsquid_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 6.23\n      flyingsquid_vs_tlm_gap_pp: -5.92\n      flyingsquid_learned_accuracies:\n        command_repetition: 0.81\n        edit_churn: 0.74\n        output_diversity: 0.69\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.85\n      flyingsquid_learned_correlations: \"cmd_rep ↔ edit_churn: 0.34\"\n      probe_on_fs_labels_gold_f1: 0.8312\n      probe_on_fs_vs_mv_gain_pp: 3.14\n      probe_on_fs_vs_tlm_gap_pp: -2.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过三元组统计估计 LF accuracies 和 pairwise correlations，在 conf=1 区域能利用\n      cross-LF correlation 信息改进标签（0.71 vs MV 0.64）。但它假设 i.i.d.——不知道 command_repetition\n      是 leading indicator（在 stagnation onset 前 1-2 步就亮灯），也不知道 outcome_bp 是 lagging indicator。\n      在 stagnation 边界窗口上 FlyingSquid 的改进有限，因为这些窗口的 LF 投票模式与序列位置强相关——\n      这正是 TLM 的时序建模所捕获的。FlyingSquid 相对 MV +6.2pp 但相对 TLM -5.9pp。\n      在 FlyingSquid 标签上训练的 probe gold F1=0.83——比 MV probe 好但比 TLM probe 差 2.7pp。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Label model ladder — MV | FlyingSquid | TLM — gold F1 + conf=1 acc + probe downstream F1\"\n      - \"Table: FlyingSquid learned LF accuracies and correlations\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: MV vs FlyingSquid vs TLM 在 gold set 上的 macro-F1，含 error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 作为 \"static correlation-aware label model\" 是 MV 和 TLM 之间的合理中间点。\n      它回答了 reviewer concern：\"为什么不用 label model？\"——答案是\"用了更好的 label model\"，\n      FlyingSquid 改进了 MV 但不如 TLM，因为它缺少时序建模。这形成了清晰的 ablation 阶梯。\n\n  - name: \"Outcome BP sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露分析：占比统计 + hold-out 重训练 + last-N variant\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 0.68\n      exit_context_window_pct: 0.23\n      outcome_bp_only_trigger_pct: 0.089\n      holdout_probe_macro_f1: 0.8978\n      holdout_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.18\n      holdout_gold_macro_f1: 0.8462\n      holdout_gold_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.21\n      last_3_windows_only_bp_f1: 0.9012\n      last_5_windows_only_bp_f1: 0.9034\n      last_3_vs_full_drop_pp: 0.43\n      tlm_holdout_bp_gold_f1: 0.8289\n      tlm_holdout_vs_full_drop_pp: 1.24\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 仅在轨迹末尾的 ~23% 窗口上触发（last 1-3 windows of each trajectory），\n      且仅 8.9% 的窗口是 outcome_bp 唯一投票者（即 outcome_bp 是 tie-breaker 的场景很少）。\n      Hold-out outcome_bp 后 probe F1 仅下降 1.18pp（conf≥2 上）和 1.21pp（gold set 上），\n      因为 outcome_bp 的信号与其他 LFs 高度相关——特别是 command_repetition 在 stagnation 结束前\n      已经停止触发（leading indicator），outcome_bp 是 lagging confirmation 而非独立新信息。\n      Last-N-windows-only variant（仅在最后 3/5 个窗口上使用 BP）几乎无性能变化（-0.43pp），\n      进一步证明 BP 不是 \"从未来偷信息\" 而是 \"确认其他 LFs 已暗示的趋势\"。\n      TLM 在 hold-out BP 后 gold F1 下降 1.24pp，同样在 2pp 阈值内。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Outcome BP coverage — metric | value\"\n      - \"Table: Hold-out sensitivity — condition | conf≥2 F1 | gold F1 | drop\"\n      - \"Table: Last-N-only variant — N | F1 | drop\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 每个 LF 在 stagnation/progress windows 上的触发率，标注 outcome_bp 的占比\"\n      - \"Line chart: hold-out outcome_bp 前后 probe 在 trajectory 不同位置上的 F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      泄露可忽略。Hold-out drop 1.18-1.21pp 远低于 2pp 阈值。核心原因是 outcome_bp 作为 lagging indicator\n      提供的信息被其他 LFs 的 leading/concurrent signals 大量冗余覆盖。\n      Last-N variant 进一步表明即使限制 BP 到轨迹末尾，信号损失极小。\n      论文可自信 claim：outcome_bp 不构成信息泄露，TLM 中它作为 lagging role 被适当加权。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 消融实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Window size ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7 窗口大小消融\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.8812\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.9134\n      k3_stag_f1: 0.8195\n      k5_stag_f1: 0.8724\n      k7_stag_f1: 0.8703\n      k3_latency_ms: 1.9\n      k5_latency_ms: 3.1\n      k7_latency_ms: 4.8\n      optimal_k: 5\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3 信号积累不足——3 步窗口内 stagnation 和短暂 hesitation 难以区分（stag-F1 下降 5.3pp）。\n      k=5 是 sweet spot：足够长以捕获 progress/stagnation 的时序签名，但不至于跨越 stagnation onset/offset 边界\n      而模糊信号。k=7 略低于 k=5（-0.5pp），因为过长窗口混入 transition 区域（前 3 步 progress + 后 4 步 stagnation\n      的窗口被标为 stagnation，但 GRU 从前半段提取到 progress 信号导致混淆）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Window size sweep — k | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | latency\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: macro-F1 vs k (3,5,7), 含 stagnation-F1 和 progress-F1 子曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5 是最优窗口大小，k=3 和 k=7 均有少量退化但 pattern 不同（k=3 检测力不足，k=7 信号模糊）。\n      论文报告 k=5 作为 default 并展示消融表。\n\n  - name: \"Architecture ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.9023\n      transformer_4layer_macro_f1: 0.9078\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      gru_attention_params: 847362\n      transformer_params: 2134528\n      gru_attention_vs_meanpool_gap_pp: 1.62\n      gru_attention_vs_transformer_gap_pp: 1.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention（默认配置）最优，因为 attention 允许模型在 stagnation onset 附近的关键 step 上\n      集中权重——这与 temporal label model 发现的 leading indicator 机制一致。\n      GRU+mean-pool 下降 1.6pp——mean-pooling 丢失了窗口内位置信息。\n      Transformer 4-layer 接近但略低（-1.1pp），且参数量 2.5× 大于 GRU——在 5-step 短序列上\n      self-attention 相对 recurrent 没有明显优势，且更容易过拟合。\n      MLP on pooled 最差（0.857），与 baseline-meanpool-lr 一致，证明时序建模是核心增量。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture comparison — arch | macro-F1 | params | latency\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 4 architectures 在 macro-F1, stag-F1, prog-F1, latency, params 上的对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构选择不是论文 novelty——GRU+attention 是合理的工程选择。消融证明时序建模（GRU）是关键（+6pp vs MLP），\n      attention 提供小幅增量（+1.6pp）。论文降权架构讨论，将 novelty 锚定在 temporal label model。\n\n  - name: \"LF hold-one-out ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个 LF 重新训练 temporal label model + probe，量化各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_model_gold_f1: 0.8583\n      holdout_command_repetition_gold_f1: 0.8198\n      holdout_edit_churn_gold_f1: 0.8367\n      holdout_output_diversity_gold_f1: 0.8451\n      holdout_outcome_bp_gold_f1: 0.8462\n      marginal_command_repetition_pp: 3.85\n      marginal_edit_churn_pp: 2.16\n      marginal_output_diversity_pp: 1.32\n      marginal_outcome_bp_pp: 1.21\n      holdout_all_except_cmd_rep_f1: 0.7845\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition 贡献最大（-3.85pp when held out），因为它是 stagnation 的最直接信号\n      （agent 反复执行相似命令）且是 leading indicator——在 stagnation onset 最先触发，\n      temporal label model 赋予它高权重。edit_churn 第二（-2.16pp），覆盖 command_repetition\n      未捕获的 \"编辑同一文件不同位置\" 模式。output_diversity 和 outcome_bp 边际贡献较小（1-1.3pp），\n      因为它们的信号与前两个 LFs 有较高冗余（尤其 outcome_bp 作为 lagging indicator 被其他 LFs 先行覆盖）。\n      仅保留 command_repetition 时 F1=0.78——单 LF 仍有效但不够。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF hold-one-out — held-out LF | gold F1 | drop | rank\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 从 full model F1 到 hold-one-out 的各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    analysis: >\n      4 个 LFs 均有正边际贡献，command_repetition 最重要。这支持了 temporal label model 中\n      对 leading indicator 的加权——贡献最大的 LF 恰好是 leading indicator。\n      且没有任何单一 LF 的 hold-out 导致 F1 低于 0.82，说明 LFs 间有健康的信号冗余。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon auxiliary loss ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无 supervised contrastive loss 对 F1 和 embedding 分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9247\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      supcon_gain_pp: 0.62\n      with_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.71\n      without_supcon_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      supcon_weight: 0.1\n      supcon_temperature: 0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon 辅助损失（weight=0.1）对 F1 的直接增量很小（+0.62pp），但对 hidden state 的几何结构\n      影响显著（silhouette score 0.71 vs 0.58）。这是因为 SupCon 鼓励同类样本在 hidden space 中聚拢、\n      异类分离，使 decision boundary 更 robust——但由于 GRU+CE loss 已经足够强，F1 增量有限。\n      主要价值在 interpretability：更清晰的 embedding 分离使 t-SNE 可视化更直观。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: SupCon ablation — condition | macro-F1 | silhouette | intra-class dist | inter-class dist\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side t-SNE: with vs without SupCon 的 hidden state 分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 对 F1 贡献有限但改善 embedding 质量。论文可将其作为 optional enhancement 报告。\n      不是论文的 key contribution——如果空间紧张可放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP structural baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征（行数改动、命令类型、test counts）分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.6823\n      structural_gbdt_macro_f1: 0.7245\n      structural_features_count: 18\n      structural_best_features: [\"lines_changed_std\", \"unique_commands_ratio\", \"test_run_count\"]\n      nlp_probe_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      nlp_vs_structural_gap_pp: 19.40\n      combined_structural_plus_nlp_macro_f1: 0.9201\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征（行数改动方差、唯一命令比例、测试执行次数等 18 维）在 GBDT 上达到 0.72——\n      证明 structural signals 有一定判别力（特别是 \"lines_changed_std\" 捕获重复编辑模式），\n      但远逊于 NL embedding probe（-19.4pp）。这是因为结构特征无法捕获语义层面的信息：\n      \"修改了 10 行\" 不区分 \"修了一个 bug\" 和 \"做了无效修改又撤销\"。\n      结构+NL 结合（0.92）几乎无增量（+0.16pp），说明 NL embedding 已涵盖结构信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Feature set comparison — features | model | macro-F1\"\n      - \"Table: Top-5 structural feature importances\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: structural vs NL vs combined\"\n    analysis: >\n      NL embedding 必要且充分。纯结构 baseline 0.72 远低于 probe 0.92——\n      证明 progress/stagnation 判定需要理解 action 语义而非仅计数。\n      这强化了论文在 NLP venue 的 fit：NL 是解决此问题的核心。\n\n  - name: \"Encoder ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE 对 probe 性能的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_06b_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      bge_m3_macro_f1: 0.9034\n      e5_large_macro_f1: 0.8978\n      gte_base_macro_f1: 0.8845\n      qwen3_embed_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_embed_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      gte_base_embed_dim: 768\n      qwen3_vs_worst_gap_pp: 3.40\n      encoding_time_per_window_ms:\n        qwen3: 35\n        bge_m3: 38\n        e5_large: 42\n        gte_base: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 最优（0.9185）因为它在 code-related text 上的预训练数据更丰富——\n      agent trajectories 包含大量代码片段和命令行输出，这是 Qwen3 的优势领域。\n      BGE-M3 紧随其后（-1.5pp），E5-large（-2.1pp）和 GTE（-3.4pp）依次下降。\n      但最差的 GTE 仍达 0.88——说明 probe 对 encoder 选择有中等敏感度但不脆弱。\n      方差 3.4pp 表明 encoder 质量有影响但不是 make-or-break factor。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Encoder comparison — encoder | dim | macro-F1 | stag-F1 | prog-F1 | encoding time\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 encoders 的 macro-F1 排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      Encoder 选择有影响但 probe 方法 robust——最差 encoder 仍 0.88。\n      论文用 Qwen3 作为 default 并在 appendix 报告消融。\n      这回应了 reviewer concern \"embedding model unspecified\"——具名 + 消融。\n\n  - name: \"Human annotation gold set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口 3-annotator 人工标注，Fleiss κ，重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 412\n      annotator_count: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.823\n      majority_agreement_pct: 0.91\n      unanimous_agreement_pct: 0.74\n      gold_label_distribution:\n        progress: 248\n        stagnation: 164\n      inter_annotator_disagreement_patterns: \"主要分歧在 transition 窗口（stagnation onset/offset ±1 步）\"\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.7198\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.7821\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8413\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.7985\n      probe_on_mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.8312\n      probe_on_tlm_gold_macro_f1: 0.8583\n      llm_judge_cot_gold_macro_f1: 0.8134\n      repeat3_gold_macro_f1: 0.5891\n      meanpool_lr_gold_macro_f1: 0.7823\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.82 属 \"almost perfect agreement\" 范围——progress/stagnation 在窗口级别是 annotators\n      可靠标注的任务（不像 step-level 需要细粒度判断）。74% 全体一致，91% 多数一致。\n      分歧主要在 transition 窗口——stagnation 刚开始或刚结束的 1-2 个窗口，annotators 对 \"还在探索\"\n      vs \"已经卡住\" 的判断不同。这正是 temporal label model 改进最大的区域。\n      Gold set 上所有方法的排序与论文 narrative 完美一致：TLM probe (0.86) > LLM CoT (0.81) > LF oracle (0.80)\n      > FlyingSquid (0.78) > mean-pool (0.78) > MV (0.72) > Repeat-3 (0.59)。\n      破解了 circular evaluation concern——所有数字都在 human labels 上重新评估。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Gold set — all methods ranked by macro-F1 on human annotations\"\n      - \"Table: Inter-annotator agreement — κ, agreement %, disagreement patterns\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 所有方法在 gold set 上的 macro-F1 排序\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix: annotator 间的 label agreement heatmap\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.82 在 [0.75, 0.90] 范围内，gold set 评估可信。所有 claims 在 human labels 上验证通过：\n      (1) TLM > MV +12.15pp, TLM > FS +5.92pp；\n      (2) Probe > LF oracle +5.98pp (student exceeds teacher)；\n      (3) Probe > LLM CoT +4.49pp (cost-accuracy Pareto)。\n      Gold set 是论文最关键的 contribution——将整个评估从自动标签上移到人工标注上。\n\n  - name: \"LF temporal dynamics analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后的触发时序：leading vs concurrent vs lagging\"\n    expected_results:\n      stagnation_onset_windows_analyzed: 3847\n      command_repetition_mean_offset: -1.82\n      command_repetition_offset_std: 0.94\n      command_repetition_role: \"leading\"\n      edit_churn_mean_offset: -0.34\n      edit_churn_offset_std: 1.21\n      edit_churn_role: \"concurrent\"\n      output_diversity_mean_offset: 0.12\n      output_diversity_offset_std: 1.08\n      output_diversity_role: \"concurrent\"\n      outcome_bp_mean_offset: 2.13\n      outcome_bp_offset_std: 1.45\n      outcome_bp_role: \"lagging\"\n      offset_significance_p_values:\n        command_repetition: 0.00003\n        edit_churn: 0.14\n        output_diversity: 0.38\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.00001\n      granger_causality_cmd_rep_to_stag_p: 0.002\n      mutual_information_lf_pairs:\n        cmd_rep_edit_churn: 0.28\n        cmd_rep_outcome_bp: 0.15\n        edit_churn_output_div: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 3,847 个 stagnation onset 窗口上对齐分析：\n      command_repetition 平均在 onset 前 1.82 步开始触发（leading，p<0.001）——\n      agent 在完全陷入 stagnation 前就开始出现命令重复的早期信号。\n      edit_churn 和 output_diversity 与 onset 基本同步（offset ≈ 0，p>0.1，concurrent）。\n      outcome_bp 平均在 onset 后 2.13 步才触发（lagging，p<0.001）——\n      因为 outcome 信息需要轨迹进一步推进才能\"回传\"到当前窗口判定。\n      Granger causality 测试证实 command_repetition → stagnation onset 存在预测关系（p=0.002）。\n      这些发现直接构成 temporal label model 的实证基础——知道了哪个 LF 领先/滞后，\n      就能在标签聚合时做时序加权而非 naive 等权投票。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LF temporal roles — LF | mean offset | std | role | p-value\"\n      - \"Table: Granger causality and mutual information between LF pairs\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"时序图: stagnation onset 对齐（t=0），各 LF 触发概率 vs time offset（-5 到 +5 步）\"\n      - \"Heatmap: LF pair mutual information matrix\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF 时序动态是 temporal label model 的实证基础——如果 LFs 没有显著的 leading/lagging 差异，\n      temporal label model 就退化为 FlyingSquid。但实验清晰证明 command_repetition leads by ~1.8 steps\n      且 outcome_bp lags by ~2.1 steps（均 p<0.001）——i.i.d. 假设确实被违反，且违反方式是有结构的。\n      这支撑了论文 Claim 1 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 扩展实验\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data scaling curve\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据 → probe F1 曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct_10_macro_f1: 0.8234\n      pct_25_macro_f1: 0.8712\n      pct_50_macro_f1: 0.9023\n      pct_100_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      pct_10_n_windows: 1540\n      pct_25_n_windows: 3850\n      pct_50_n_windows: 7700\n      pct_100_n_windows: 15401\n      diminishing_returns_knee: \"~40%\"\n      pct_50_vs_100_gap_pp: 1.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      10% 数据（1,540 windows）probe 已达 0.82——GRU 在少量高质量标签上也能学到基本的 progress/stagnation 分界。\n      25% 提升到 0.87，50% 达 0.90——收益递减拐点约在 40%（~6,000 windows）。\n      50% → 100% 仅提升 1.6pp，表明 15K windows 已接近 conf≥2 子集的信息饱和。\n      这对实际部署有价值：不需要完整数据集也能获得 >90% 的性能。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Data scaling — pct | n_windows | macro-F1 | stag-F1\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x=training data pct (log scale), y=macro-F1, with 95% CI bands\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 数据效率较高——50% 数据达 98% 性能。论文报告此结果以指导实际标注预算。\n      放 appendix 即可，不是核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Early termination simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在 held-out 轨迹上模拟基于 probe 预测的 early termination，计算 tokens saved vs success rate\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_held_out_trajectories: 487\n      terminate_after_3_consecutive_stag:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 31.2\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 94.7\n        false_termination_rate: 0.053\n      terminate_after_5_consecutive_stag:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 22.8\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 97.9\n        false_termination_rate: 0.021\n      optimal_threshold: \"4 consecutive stagnation windows\"\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 27.4\n      optimal_success_preserved_pct: 96.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 487 条 held-out 轨迹上模拟：当 probe 连续 N 个窗口预测 stagnation 时 terminate。\n      N=3 较激进——节省 31% tokens 但 5.3% 的成功轨迹被误杀（false termination）。\n      N=5 较保守——节省 23% tokens，false termination 仅 2.1%。\n      N=4 是最佳平衡点——27% tokens saved，96.8% success preserved，false termination 3.2%。\n      节省的 tokens 主要来自 \"长尾 stagnation\"——agent 在最后 10+ 步完全卡住但继续尝试直到 token limit。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Termination threshold sweep — N | tokens saved % | success preserved % | false term %\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved vs success rate preserved, 标注 N=3,4,5\"\n      - \"Histogram: terminated 轨迹的 remaining tokens 分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination 是 probe 的直接应用价值——在不显著影响成功率的前提下节省 27% tokens。\n      论文放 discussion/application 章节，不是核心 claim 但增加实用性。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"t-SNE/UMAP 可视化 GRU hidden states + attention weight 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.58\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.63\n      attention_peak_at_stag_onset: true\n      attention_weight_first_step_mean: 0.14\n      attention_weight_last_step_mean: 0.28\n      attention_weight_max_step_mean: 0.31\n      cluster_purity_progress: 0.89\n      cluster_purity_stagnation: 0.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hidden states 在 t-SNE/UMAP 上形成两个主要簇（progress/stagnation），但有重叠区域（silhouette=0.58-0.63）——\n      重叠主要来自 transition 窗口。SupCon 版本簇更紧致（silhouette=0.71）。\n      Attention weights 在窗口的后半段集中（last 2 steps 占 ~59% attention weight），\n      尤其在 stagnation onset 窗口上 attention 集中在第 4-5 步（模型关注 \"重复模式确认\" 的时刻）。\n      这与 leading indicator 分析一致：模型需要看到足够的步才能确认 stagnation 模式。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Attention weight distribution — step position | mean weight | std\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE scatter: hidden states colored by label, shaped by conf level\"\n      - \"UMAP scatter: same data, alternative projection\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 20 example windows, 5 steps × attention weight, sorted by predicted stag probability\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化提供直觉支持：(a) hidden states 形成可分的簇结构，(b) attention 集中在后步——\n      模型等待足够证据才做判断。论文放 qualitative analysis 章节，辅助 reviewers 理解模型行为。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4c96712c-1f0d-4f76-a0a8-e9fe3e229a01","total_cost_usd":0.587728,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12614,"cache_read_input_tokens